WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.461
Captain Nova frowned.

2
00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:08.269
"We can't waste vegetables," she said.

3
00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.182
"I didn't!" Ringo said.

4
00:00:11.183 --> 00:00:13.158
"Lucy did!"

5
00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:18.599
Lucy huffed. "I was just having fun."

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.641
Captain Nova folded her arms. "Fun?"

7
00:00:22.642 --> 00:00:26.767
Lucy nodded. "I wanted to cheer up Tiny.

8
00:00:26.768 --> 00:00:29.630
He was crying."

9
00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:33.544
Ringo took a deep breath.

10
00:00:33.545 --> 00:00:37.090
"I wasn't crying," he said.

11
00:00:37.091 --> 00:00:44.364
Lucy grinned. "Yes, you were!"

12
00:00:44.365 --> 00:00:49.885
Then Ringo saw something.

13
00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:52.665
"Flame peppers!" he said.

14
00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:56.775
Two flame peppers sat in a small box.

15
00:00:56.776 --> 00:01:02.638
"Oh!" Captain Nova bit her lip.

16
00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:06.321
"I'm, um, saving them."

17
00:01:06.322 --> 00:01:09.442
"Why?" Ringo asked.

18
00:01:09.443 --> 00:01:13.919
Captain Nova shrugged. "We didn't get many.

19
00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.030
I wanted them for lunch."

20
00:01:17.031 --> 00:01:23.745
Ringo sighed. "Something strange is going on."

21
00:01:23.746 --> 00:01:28.203
"Rosco didn't have any moon roots," Lucy said.

22
00:01:28.204 --> 00:01:35.450
"There were only four . . . er, six flame peppers."

23
00:01:35.451 --> 00:01:39.182
"There aren't enough vegetables," Ringo said.

24
00:01:39.183 --> 00:01:42.657
"Where does Space Patrol get vegetables?"

25
00:01:42.658 --> 00:01:47.415
Captain Nova shrugged. "I'm not sure."

26
00:01:47.416 --> 00:01:49.822
"Bot," Ringo said.

27
00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:53.701
"Where do we get our vegetables?"

28
00:01:53.702 --> 00:01:57.009
"Planet Green," Bot said.

29
00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:01.488
"A farmer named Bex grows them."

30
00:02:01.489 --> 00:02:05.421
"Hmm." Ringo tapped his chin.

31
00:02:05.422 --> 00:02:09.462
"Maybe Bex has a vegetable problem.

32
00:02:09.463 --> 00:02:19.857
Captain, we'll go to Planet Green right now!"

